## 2. Locate Bug Locations

- In `src/ol/expr/cpu.js`, update `compileAccessorExpression` so that if `name === 'id'`, it returns `context.id` (or similar).
- In `src/ol/expr/expression.js`, update `withGetArgs` so that `"id"` is not added to `context.properties` (since it's not a property, but a special field).

